@startuml
title Assistant Slashing & Freeze Flow

actor Monitor
participant "Incident Reporter" as REP
participant "Governance Module" as GOV
participant "Assistant Registry" as REG
participant "Tokenomics" as TOK
participant "Reward Escrow" as ESC

Monitor -> REP: Upload logs + evidence bundle
REP -> GOV: File SlashProposal(assistant_id, evidence)
GOV -> REG: Flag assistant (freeze payouts)
REG --> GOV: Status=Frozen
GOV -> GOV: Open voting window
GOV -> TOK: On approval, slash bonded stake
TOK -> ESC: Deduct assistant escrow / re-route rewards
TOK --> Monitor: Pay reporter bounty (if configured)
GOV -> REG: Update assistant status = Revoked
REG --> REP: Emit Slashed event to subscribers

@enduml
